# Every text file in this repo ships VERBATIM (tar/cat over ssh) to busybox
# ash on the router — a CRLF working tree turns `do` into `do\r` and the
# on-router `ash -n` gate rejects the deploy (seen live 2026-06-10 on a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true). Force LF in the working tree
# regardless of the cloning machine's autocrlf setting. Beware: MSYS/git-bash
# grep/sed/od read files in text mode and silently hide \r — verify line
# endings by comparing `wc -c` against `git cat-file -s :path`.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
